44..107 Comment "//! `Seed` exposes an abstract counter type and its operations."
108..111 Comment "//!"
112..189 Comment "//! The checker keeps `Seed.T` separate from `Integer`. Only the members that"
190..268 Comment "//! the signature exposes reach a value of `Seed.T`. A run prints such a value"
269..340 Comment "//! as opaque at the seal, because the source does not mark `Seed.T` as"
341..354 Comment "//! `mobile`."
